==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Hidden Fates|Psyduck|11}} from the {{TCG|Hidden Fates}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-B}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Evolving Skies|Psyduck|24}} from the {{TCG|Evolving Skies}} expansion; both cards have the Rain Splash attack.
*'''Rain Splash''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Deoxys|Lotad|63}} from the {{TCG|EX Deoxys}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

